    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d973">

                <pb facs="0762" n="686" xml:id="pg686"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.48/3078</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Consul Garrett </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-03-13T17:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 13, 1916, 5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Furnish transportation cheapest rate to American refugees mentioned in your March
                    11, 2 p.m., provided they are absolutely destitute. Take same action regarding
                    American named Shafer, now in hands of Associated Charities, Laredo.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
